{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "kokoro",
  "chunk_id": "kokoro-chunk-0124",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00718",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“就连我这样的人，也没有闲待着呀，虽说没有薪水。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Even someone like me has not been sitting idle, though I do not draw a salary.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00718",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "父亲还这样说。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Father said this as well.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00718",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "尽管如此，我仍然一声不响。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Even so, I still said nothing.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00719",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“那位先生要是真像你说的那么了不起，肯定能给你找个工作的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If that先生 is really as impressive as you say, he could surely find you a job.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00719",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "拜托过他吗？”母亲问。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Have you asked him for help? Mother asked.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00720",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“没有。”我答道。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "No, I answered.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00721",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“那怎么能行啊。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "That will not do at all.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00721",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "你为什么不求他帮个忙呀？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Why do you not ask him to help you?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00721",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "给他写封信也行啊。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You could at least write him a letter.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00722",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“嗯。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Yes.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00723",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "我含糊其词地答应着，站起身，走出了父亲的房间。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I gave a vague reply, stood up, and left Father's room.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
